#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-issues.rst:59
#: 65250ae865dd45f6a4d42aab832fd6ec
msgid "The vehicle drives well, but randomly topples"
msgstr "车辆行驶正常，但随机发生倾倒"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-issues.rst:60
#: 84d405bb00b34c769b3860b017046e45
msgid ""
"This happens when GPS lock occurs while the vehicle is indoors. The best "
"solution is to disable GPS while the vehicle is used indoors. Set parameter:"
msgstr "这种情况发生在车辆在室内时获得 GPS 锁定。最佳解决方案是在室内使用时禁用 GPS。设置参数："

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-issues.rst:62
#: 880b96b1e734424680937a33373ab8bc
msgid ":ref:`GPS1_TYPE<GPS1_TYPE>` = 0 (Set this to 1 when outdoors)"
msgstr ":ref:`GPS1_TYPE<GPS1_TYPE>` = 0（在室外时将此值设为 1）"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-issues.rst:65
#: 08679c53515043e680adf51c8236fe83
msgid "The vehicle topples at higher speeds"
msgstr "车辆在较高速度下发生倾倒"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-issues.rst:66
#: 3ca4a3bee8234cb59a8b1efc40872448
msgid ""
"The motors may not have sufficient torque to balance the vehicle at these "
"speeds. Lower the maximum speed of the vehicle by bringing down the "
":ref:`CRUISE_SPEED <CRUISE_SPEED>` parameter. Another option to consider is "
"to reduce :ref:`BAL_PITCH_MAX<BAL_PITCH_MAX>`, which is the maximum pitch "
"angle in degrees."
msgstr ""
"电机在这些速度下可能没有足够的扭矩来保持车辆平衡。通过降低 :ref:`CRUISE_SPEED <CRUISE_SPEED>` "
"参数来降低车辆的最大速度。另一个可考虑的选项是减小 :ref:`BAL_PITCH_MAX<BAL_PITCH_MAX>`，该参数为最大俯仰角（度）。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-issues.rst:69
#: 01da5d2101d249bbae5e5c90e930c13e
